# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.

## Turso (SQLite cloud database)

Create a database:
  turso db create wiryo
  turso db show wiryo
  turso db tokens create wiryo

```
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://wiryo-<your-org>.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=<your-auth-token>
```

## Local development (no Turso account needed)

Leave TURSO_DATABASE_URL as a file path and TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN empty:

```
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=file:./dev.db
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=
```

## Vercel deployment

Add these variables in the Vercel project dashboard under Settings → Environment Variables.
